{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13655","headline":"陪皇甫大夫谒禹庙 · 严维","name":"陪皇甫大夫谒禹庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹使羞殷荐，松龛拜夏祠。\n爲鱼歌德後，舞羽降神时。\n文卫瞻如在，精灵信有期。\n夕阳陪醉止，塘上鸟咸迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13655.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13655","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}